---
description: Never show Expo Go, APK, or development-build hints in the app UI
alwaysApply: true
---

# No runtime / toolchain hints in the app

Never put user-facing copy about Expo Go, development builds, APKs, simulators, native modules, or how a feature will work later in another build.

If a feature cannot run in the current environment, fail silently or show a normal product error. Do not explain the toolchain.

```tsx
// BAD
<Text>Expo Go не ставит сигнал на телефон. Часы сохранятся и заработают в development build.</Text>

// GOOD
// Skip the hint. Keep the clocks in state. Do not mention Expo, APK, or builds.
```
